## Font Awesome Free 7.3.1

Icons by Fonticons, Inc. — https://fontawesome.com

Icon artwork is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Full Font Awesome Free license: https://fontawesome.com/license/free

The navigation rail's icons are Font Awesome Free icons. Their geometry is
vendored into `packages/ui/icons.ts`, generated from the installed package
by `scripts/gen-icons.mjs` — the application does not load a Font Awesome
webfont, stylesheet or sprite at runtime, because its content policy
(`QGD-SEC-0008`) allows the renderer no font and no image. Inline SVG markup is
neither, so the icons are drawn as paths.

No icon has been modified. Attribution appears here and in the application's
About panel, as CC BY 4.0 requires.

